<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Daehan Flour seeks U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daehan Flour seeks U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd has invited tenders to buy 21,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Tuesday, a Daehan offcial said on Monday.</p>
<p>The official said shipment was set for March 5-April 5 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
